"Johnny" "Lotto's up to twelve million." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/01_johnny.wav" 1.0 2.980
"Lou" "Don't waste your money." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/02_lou.wav" 4.18 1.62
"Johnny" "Somebody's gotta win." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/03_johnny.wav" 6.0 1.830
"Lou" "I hit it once. Never played again." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/04_lou.wav" 8.03 3.09
"Johnny" "You? How much?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/05_johnny.wav" 11.32 2.730
"Lou" "Enough to buy this place." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/06_lou.wav" 14.25 2.67
"Johnny" "No shit. What'd you do, pick birthdays?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/07_johnny.wav" 17.12 3.780
"Lou" "Didn't pick numbers. Picked a truck." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/08_lou.wav" 21.1 2.77
"Johnny" "A truck?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/09_johnny.wav" 24.07 1.030
"Lou" "Had the bank's name on the side." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/10_lou.wav" 25.3 2.84
"Johnny" "Right." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/11_johnny.wav" 28.71 0.730
"Lou" "Anyway. I gotta go make a delivery." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/12_lou.wav" 30.11 2.09
"Johnny" "Let me do it." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/13_johnny.wav" 32.4 1.330
"Lou" "You?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/14_lou.wav" 33.93 0.63
"Johnny" "Yeah. I've been in here all day. Let me get out of the store for a bit." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/15_johnny.wav" 34.76 5.180
"Lou" "Ya, actually, they... that might not be a bad idea." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/16_lou.wav" 40.31 4.25
"Lou" "You just need to take this to the Ostend docks up north west a bit." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/17_lou.wav" 45.43 5.13
"Johnny" "Okay I think I know where that is." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/delivery_01/balanced/18_johnny.wav" 56.83 2.58
"Lou" "Devon will be working in the bait and tackle shop, just let him know I sent you." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/lou_full_03/balanced/19_lou.wav" 59.73 4.8100000000000005
